{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793804246600791002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"synonymous-destined-cricket","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"28c7068b893645deec8bb597b4db6a05f6801fdaa9d7a9546bfdb30c934e48bc","event_uuid":"67d87b1e-1ed6-428c-a217-913c82b75723","position":{"commit_sha":"b3ccc9405169e4bd4f1a655e4e60c9ea1f3238a0","position":"1793804211554605001-67d87b1e-1ed6-428c-a217-913c82b75723"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"7dc8ce3f1135137b69dbbae7164a1c93a47361b75c022a8bd90004e41ee9c14d","event_uuid":"557d8936-fd17-4fc5-bd64-a23671e4a890","position":{"commit_sha":"d4fd6893fa1960df8304d1bed8fb8d4169927c7e","position":"1793804246600791001-557d8936-fd17-4fc5-bd64-a23671e4a890"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793804211554605001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"557d8936-fd17-4fc5-bd64-a23671e4a890","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"b0f0-3dd2-fcf2-4707"}],"description":"## Observation\n`ensure_fresh` (`src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py:192`) spawns `git rev-parse --verify <branch>` (line 221) on every read, before it checks the 60 s `/tmp/.ticket-sync-*` marker throttle. A throttled read therefore still costs 1 git process. Measured on the `rebar audit serve` index (`src/rebar/audit/server.py` `_audited_tickets`): one render with 1 audited ticket spawns 5 git processes while throttled (1 from `list_tickets`, 4 from the `show_ticket` / `verify_signature` reads inside `audit_trail`), so the index costs 1 + 4N git spawns per request for N tickets. Under host load that per-spawn cost dominates the request.\n\nDiscovered while root-causing smalltime-repressive-sealion (b0f0-3dd2-fcf2-4707).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A throttled read (marker younger than 60 s) spawns no git process, shown by a test that counts git spawns.\n- [ ] The branch-existence check still runs before any fetch on an unthrottled read.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"40c3-d22a-3872-4c8c","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Throttled reads still spawn a git rev-parse each","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["67d87b1e-1ed6-428c-a217-913c82b75723","557d8936-fd17-4fc5-bd64-a23671e4a890"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793804246600791002,"uuid":"ea561c51-c35d-4909-bcf9-1f84b335df25"}